#21400
The Antechamber of Light That Is Not Light~
   The corridor opens into a vast space filled with a grey radiance that has
no source and casts no shadows. It is cold, and silent, and it goes on
forever. Figures kneel in rows in the radiance, millions of them, every soul
the West has ever taken, facing the same way.
~
