#21401
Among the Kneeling Host~
   You walk between the kneeling dead. Kings and beggars, soldiers and
children, the Reaver and the Bandit Lord, faces you passed on the road. They
do not look at you. They look west, toward the heart of the radiance, where
something waits that is too large to see.
~
