#21403
The Place of Unbecoming~
   Here the grey radiance thickens into a fog that unmakes whatever it
touches. Your hand, held out before you, goes faint at the edges. Things
that were once heroes drift in the fog, half unmade, reaching for you,
wanting to share what is left of them.
~
