#21404
The Seat of Nu'Groth~
   At the heart of the radiance there is nothing, and the nothing is aware
of you. It has a shape only because your mind insists on giving it one: a
vast dark figure seated on nothing, larger than mountains, closer than your
own breath. It has no face. It is the source of all evil in the realm, and
it has noticed you.
~
