#21405
The Hall of Unspoken Names~
   North of the antechamber a hall of grey stone is carved floor to ceiling
with names, every name of every soul the West has taken, and Nu'Groth is
slowly erasing them. Something tall walks the hall with a chisel, and where
it passes the names are gone.
~
