#21410
Where the First Hero Kneels~
   West of the fog, alone, kneels the first hero who ever reached the Seat:
a woman in armour older than any kingdom, her sword across her knees. She
has knelt here since the world was young. She is not entirely unmade. She is
not entirely on your side.
~
